{"id":"e7e5eddb-819a-4432-ac63-926c2f7c7bbe","object":"chat.completion","created":1793244776,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"thought\":\"Update the multi_agent note with p35 content (theory of mind, role-based interaction, multi-LLM strategic behavior) now that it has been received.\",\"code\":\"n=write_note(title='multi_agent',content='p35 §4.1.3 心智理论：LLM 可过儿童/临床心智理论测试，但早期结论受训练数据污染质疑；新基准显示强商业模型达或超平均人类水平，是否具可泛化心智理论仍待研究。§4.2 角色互动：多智能体系统与 agent 模拟历史悠久，LLM 用自然语言交流克服建模与成本限制，推动博弈论、角色互动与团队合作研究。§4.2.1 多 LLM 策略行为：MAgIC 用 Undercover/Chameleon 等游戏评七项特征，GPT-o1/GPT-4 领先，LLM 判断力、理性、合作偏高，推理偏低、协调普遍低；GPT-o1 加概率图模型可全面提升。GAMA-Bench 覆盖 Guess 2/3、El Farol 等，GPT-3.5 稳健但泛化有限，CoT 可提升，GPT-4 最佳。',evidence_ids=['ev-a9b70da77a1c104405a2'],section='multi_agent')\\nprint(n.get('note_id'),n.get('chars'))\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"ev-a9b70da77a1c104405a2\"]}"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8666,"completion_tokens":325,"total_tokens":8991,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":4480},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":4480,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":4186},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}